contentText:
Lizzo has spoken out after one of the lawsuits against her was dismissed by a federal judge on Tuesday (Sept. 1).

In a video posted to Instagram shortly after the ruling, the hitmaker stood in front of the camera without speaking, looking thoughtful. In text layered over the clip, she wrote, &#8220;Today I am relieved to announce that I have won the case against me and my touring company Big Grrrl Touring.&#8221;

